    "reviews": "\u201cKaraoke is sort of choose your own adventure already, but Evergreen Blues aims to make it more so, allowing you and a friend to build the lyrics to the song as you go.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cEvergreen Blues is a game unlike any others that I have ever played.\u201d<br>Indie Games Plus<br><br>\u201c[T]he game's vocals [...] wait for the player to make a selection before playing and yet -- at least in the demo I tried at PAX East -- always seem to fit in appropriately with the tempo and mood of the lines before.\u201d<br>GamesIndustry<br>",
